--- !u!114 &2055817110
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2055817108}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 193c7ccdb07da7343bcf5ae1af1c21fa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  documentEntries:
  - As we suspected, our fears have been realized over the last few months. Soviet
    technology appears to be 5 to 15 years ahead of our own. Most schematics remain
    heavily classified, and the machines recovered so far are too complex to reverse
    engineer with our current resources.;Yet something is far more disturbing. Throughout
    my investigation at [REDACTED], I have found no signs of human activity. No workers,
    no guards, not a single living soul. And yet, the facilities continue to operate.
  - The threat appears to be far more extensive than I initially estimated. Security
    systems, surveillance networks, and possibly even military operations seem to
    be operating under a single, unidentified authority.;More concerning is the consistency
    of the anomalies. Identical incidents have been recorded across multiple locations,
    often following the same sequence of events. Whether these occurrences are coordinated
    or the result of something else remains unknown.
  - Communication channels may also be compromised. Several transmissions have shown
    irregularities, though I have been unable to determine their source. There is
    no conclusive evidence that our reports have been intercepted.;I have also noticed
    inconsistencies in the surveillance records. Some logs appear to describe events
    before they occur, while others contain details that should not have been observable.
    Further investigation is required.
  onDocumentConfirmed:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 2055817108}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
        m_MethodName: SetActive
        m_Mode: 6
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
      - m_Target: {fileID: 132828511}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
        m_MethodName: SetActive
        m_Mode: 6
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 1
        m_CallState: 2
  documentText: {fileID: 171235755}
  BackButton: {fileID: 806881981}
  NextButton: {fileID: 259967045}
  ConfirmButton: {fileID: 1457392423}
  ConfirmButtonText: {fileID: 790360643}
  enabledColor: {r: 0, g: 0.6981132, b: 0.19163895, a: 1}
  disabledColor: {r: 0.3735848, g: 0.3735848, b: 0.3735848, a: 1}
  alteredDocument: 'XXXXXXXXXX channels may also be XXXXXXXXX. Several XXXXXXX have
    shown XXXXXXX, though I have been XXXXXX to XXXXXXX their XXXXXX. XXXXX is XXX
